---
import { ACQUISITION_MAILTO, SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<footer class="relative z-10 border-t border-zinc-800 bg-black">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-red-900/25 bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-900 via-black to-red-950/20 p-8 sm:p-12 mb-12">
      <div
        class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-red-600/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"
        aria-hidden="true"
      ></div>
      <div
        class="absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-blue-600/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"
        aria-hidden="true"
      ></div>

      <div class="relative z-10 grid lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] gap-10 items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[3px] text-red-500 font-extrabold mb-4">Domain Available for Acquisition</p>
          <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-4xl tracking-tight mb-4">
            liecheatorsteal.com — A Category-Defining Digital Asset
          </h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
            Three words. One unforgettable domain. Positioned at the intersection of political commentary, viral
            memorability, and premium brand equity — this is a rare strategic asset for serious buyers. Inquire for
            pricing, transfer logistics, and escrow options.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/90 backdrop-blur-xl">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[2px] text-zinc-500 font-semibold mb-2">Acquisition Contact</p>
          <a
            href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}
            class="block text-2xl sm:text-3xl heading-font text-white hover:text-red-500 transition-colors break-all"
          >
            {SITE.email}
          </a>
          <a
            href={ACQUISITION_MAILTO}
            class="mt-6 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-x-3 px-6 py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 to-red-700 text-white font-extrabold rounded-2xl hover:brightness-110 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-red-950/40"
          >
            <span>Inquire About Acquisition</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
          </a>
          <p class="mt-4 text-[11px] text-zinc-500 text-center tracking-wide">
            Confidential inquiries &bull; Response within 24 hours
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl mb-10">
      This website is for demonstration and informational purposes only. It does not constitute an offer of services,
      a commitment to deploy, or a guarantee of outcomes. All statistics, projections, and references to specific
      technologies are based on publicly available information as of July 2, 2026 and are subject to change.
    </p>

    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-x-2 mb-6">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-mask text-red-500"></i>
      <i class="fa-solid fa-dice text-yellow-500"></i>
      <i class="fa-solid fa-hand-holding-dollar text-blue-500"></i>
      <span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[3px] text-red-600 ml-2">LIECHEATORSTEAL.COM</span>
    </div>

    <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 max-w-md mx-auto text-center mb-8">
      This site exists to document the pattern. Not affiliated with any political party.
      Facts drawn from public records, official statements, congressional disclosures, and verified reporting.
      The trifecta is the business model.
    </p>

    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-zinc-800 text-xs text-zinc-600 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-y-4 items-center justify-between">
      <div>&copy; 2026 liecheatorsteal.com. All rights reserved.</div>
      <div class="font-mono tracking-widest">BUILT TO EXPOSE &bull; TRUTH DOESN'T NEED SPIN</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
